# NYITSec writable workspace: additional exclusions (simple glob patterns)
# The following files are ALWAYS excluded by .workspace.py:
# .init, .workspace.py, .ctfignore, verify, bin/, README.md, DESCRIPTION.md
# One additional filename, path, or directory prefix per line.
# Examples: *.bak  or  private-notes/
# Do not use negation (!) rules. This is a small subset of gitignore syntax.
